data: {"id": "16ea2aac140e41aa-thinking-layer-374", "run_id": "16ea2aac140e41aa", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 异常定位\n\n1. **异常 Pod**：`aiops-case-v08/workload`\n2. **异常状态**：`CrashLoopBackOff`（0/1 Ready, 已重启 11 次）\n3. **异常组拆分**：该 Pod 属于单一异常组，归一化类型为 `CrashLoopBackOffRuntime`（需进一步区分是否为 OOMKilled）。\n4. **关联 Runbook**：\n   - `pod-crashloop-runtime.md`：用于排查进程退出、命令错误、探针失败等。\n   - `pod-oomkilled.md`：用于排查因内存超限导致的 CrashLoopBackOff。\n\n接下来，我将通过 `kubectl describe` 和 `kubectl logs` 获取详细证据，以区分具体的 CrashLoopBackOff 根因。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789133748091}

