data: {"id": "16ea2aac140e41aa-thinking-parallel_evidence-1659", "run_id": "16ea2aac140e41aa", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已获取全部关键事实，无需进一步补证。\n\n### 已采集事实\n*   **身份**：Pod `workload` (UID `00e5e755`...) 处于 `CrashLoopBackOff`，已重启 11 次。\n*   **根因证据 (Exit Code 127)**：\n    *   `previous_logs`：报错 `sh: exec: line 0: /opt/app/unavailable-command: not found`。\n    *   `describe`：Exit Code 确认为 **127**，表示命令在容器内不存在。\n    *   `yaml`：容器 `app` 的 `command` 字段确认为 `[\"sh\", \"-c\", \"exec /opt/app/unavailable-command\"]`。\n*   **状态**：Pod 运行在 `node2` 上，但 `Ready=False` (ContainersNotReady)。\n\n### 冲突与缺口\n*   **无冲突**：日志报错内容 (127)、Exit Code、Command 配置三者", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789133797097, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

